event: datastar-patch-elements
data: selector #analysis-panel
data: mode outer
data: elements <!-- Reference panel. Root renders escaped placeholders server-side, never as expressions. -->
data: elements <section id="analysis-panel" data-analysis-version="1" data-view-revision="1">
data: elements <div class="card"><header class="card-header"><div><span class="eyebrow">ОБЗОР ЖУРНАЛА</span><h2>Результаты анализа</h2></div></header><div class="card-body"><p class="log-name">S24-filter.xes</p><div class="stats-grid"><div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">Трассы</span><strong class="stat-value">4</strong></div><div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">События</span><strong class="stat-value">10</strong></div><div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">Действия</span><strong class="stat-value">3</strong></div><div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">Варианты</span><strong class="stat-value">4</strong></div></div><hr class="section-divider"><form id="threshold-form" action="/logs/log-1/view" method="post"><label class="threshold-label" for="threshold">Минимальная частота ребра <output id="threshold-value">1</output></label><input id="threshold" name="threshold" type="range" min="1" max="3" value="1" data-on:change="window.piQueueView(evt.target)"><p class="threshold-help">Порог отображения: статистика исходного журнала не меняется.</p></form><a class="button export-link" href="/logs/log-1/export" download>Сохранить результат JSON <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></div>
data: elements <div class="card"><header class="card-header"><div><span class="eyebrow">ПУТИ ПРОЦЕССА</span><h2>Варианты трасс</h2></div><span class="badge">4</span></header><div class="card-body"><div class="variant-list"><div class="variant-row"><span class="variant-path">A <span aria-hidden="true">→</span> B <span aria-hidden="true">→</span> B <span aria-hidden="true">→</span> C</span><strong class="variant-count">1</strong></div><div class="variant-row"><span class="variant-path">A <span aria-hidden="true">→</span> B <span aria-hidden="true">→</span> C</span><strong class="variant-count">1</strong></div><div class="variant-row"><span class="variant-path">A <span aria-hidden="true">→</span> C</span><strong class="variant-count">1</strong></div><div class="variant-row"><span class="variant-path">B</span><strong class="variant-count">1</strong></div></div><p class="tiny muted">Показаны первые 4 вариантов. Полный результат доступен в JSON.</p></div></div>
data: elements <div class="card case-card"><header class="card-header"><div><span class="eyebrow">ОТДЕЛЬНЫЕ ПРОХОЖДЕНИЯ</span><h2>Трассы журнала</h2></div></header><div class="card-body"><div class="case-list"><button type="button" class="case-button" data-case-id="case-0" aria-pressed="true" data-on:click="window.piQueueCase(el.dataset.caseId)"><span>alpha · case-0</span><span>3 событий</span></button><button type="button" class="case-button" data-case-id="case-1" aria-pressed="false" data-on:click="window.piQueueCase(el.dataset.caseId)"><span>beta · case-1</span><span>2 событий</span></button><button type="button" class="case-button" data-case-id="case-2" aria-pressed="false" data-on:click="window.piQueueCase(el.dataset.caseId)"><span>gamma · case-2</span><span>1 событий</span></button><button type="button" class="case-button" data-case-id="case-3" aria-pressed="false" data-on:click="window.piQueueCase(el.dataset.caseId)"><span>delta · case-3</span><span>4 событий</span></button></div><p class="tiny muted">Показаны первые 20 трасс или все, если их меньше. Имена трасс могут совпадать.</p><hr class="section-divider"><div id="case-details" class="selection-details"><h3>alpha · case-0</h3><p>Событий: 3</p><ol><li>A</li><li>B</li><li>C</li></ol><p class="muted">Порядок событий — как в исходном файле.</p></div><p class="tiny muted">Подсветка показывает путь выбранной трассы. Частоты на карте относятся ко всему журналу.</p></div></div>
data: elements <div class="card"><header class="card-header"><div><span class="eyebrow">ДЕТАЛИ</span><h2>Выбранный элемент</h2></div></header><div id="element-details" class="card-body selection-details"><p class="muted">Выберите действие или стрелку на карте.</p></div></div>
data: elements <div id="graph-data" hidden data-ignore>{&quot;log_id&quot;:&quot;log-1&quot;,&quot;analysis_version&quot;:1,&quot;view_revision&quot;:1,&quot;min_edge_frequency&quot;:1,&quot;max_edge_frequency&quot;:2,&quot;nodes&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;activity-0&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;A&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:3,&quot;start_count&quot;:3,&quot;end_count&quot;:0},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;activity-1&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;B&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:4,&quot;start_count&quot;:1,&quot;end_count&quot;:1},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;activity-2&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;C&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:3,&quot;start_count&quot;:0,&quot;end_count&quot;:3}],&quot;edges&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;edge-0&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;activity-0&quot;,&quot;target&quot;:&quot;activity-1&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:2},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;edge-1&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;activity-0&quot;,&quot;target&quot;:&quot;activity-2&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;edge-2&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;activity-1&quot;,&quot;target&quot;:&quot;activity-1&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;edge-3&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;activity-1&quot;,&quot;target&quot;:&quot;activity-2&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:2}],&quot;selected_id&quot;:null,&quot;selected_case_id&quot;:&quot;case-0&quot;,&quot;case_highlight&quot;:{&quot;node_ids&quot;:[&quot;activity-0&quot;,&quot;activity-1&quot;,&quot;activity-2&quot;],&quot;edge_ids&quot;:[&quot;edge-0&quot;,&quot;edge-3&quot;]}}</div>
data: elements </section>
